{"id":"en_fake-my-death-make-him-pay","title":"Fake My Death Make Him Pay","titleEn":"Fake My Death Make Him Pay","description":"Pregnant and coerced into donating her liver for her husband's lover, Jennifer loses her life — only to be reborn with a second chance. She stages her own death to break free, and in the process discovers that she and her husband's lover were switched at birth. Digging deeper, she exposes the Powell family's brutal scheme: they had planned to keep her alive solely as a source of spare organs, and they intended to kill her mother.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fake-my-death-make-him-pay/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fake-my-death-make-him-pay/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal","Rebirth","Mistress","Substitute","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dln02/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fake-my-death-make-him-pay_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dln02/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-my-death-make-him-pay_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dln02/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-my-death-make-him-pay_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dln02/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-my-death-make-him-pay_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dln02/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-my-death-make